    "body": "Implementation plan (owner assignment: select/intake and complete one CamCraft issue). Scope: cross-drill coordinate invariance and portable chain regressions only; likely crates/motion/src/drilling/cross.rs plus the two app cross-drill test suites, with an append-only RECOMMENDED.md decision. Start at current main d794ae4 and stack on PR #204 (efd1f26), which already includes that main and changes drilling_cross_spindle.rs. Acceptance: identical ordered moves (kind, pose, endpoints and feeds, geometric tolerance only) under translated G54; fixed numeric chain expectations instead of raw float hashes; a regression that fails before the correction; unchanged stock/part/holder refusal checks. Validation: Linux reproduction of the reported tests, Windows focused quick gate and touched-crate lint, and independent static review. Bounded support agents will own baseline/gate execution, documentation and review in separate worktrees; the parent owns implementation/integration/publication. No new runtime language, dependency, data format, release, production use or protected-main merge. Risks: extra move may be floating-point zero-length dedupe, and macOS execution is unavailable; neither will be concealed by weakening topology assertions.",
