    "body": "Confirmed regression on Windows at efd1f26: radius next_up(10.0) generates 14 moves while radius 10.0 generates 13 (new kernel regression: 1 failed, 1 passed, exit 101). The captured d40 three-station chain ends in a rapid from x=-25.0 to x=-25.000000000000004. Candidate coalesces only <=1e-9 mm radial rapid residue while still recording pose changes. Numeric reference assertions preserve all ordered move kinds/feeds/poses and endpoints, intentionally omitting only that final roundoff-only rapid; move-count assertions remain strict. The only difference between the baseline regression fixture and candidate fixture is a corrected assertion-message unit, not executable logic. Candidate now goes to focused gates and independent review.",
