    "body": "fix on issue/151-cross-drill-invariance - PR #236 https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/pull/236 - commit f4f277cc2aca9a0515e93f54c3df433a4464482e - pinned by a_sub_nanometre_radius_residual_does_not_add_a_cross_drill_move, a_real_clearance_move_and_the_initial_station_pose_are_kept, a_cylinder_stock_chain_matches_its_numeric_reference, and the extended moved-G54 test. Baseline regression failed (13 vs 14 moves); candidate regression passed 2/0, canonical quick selected suites passed 1150/0/17 ignored, Clippy exited 0, and independent static review found no actionable issues. Quick gate emitted its complete successful summary, but the outer remote wrapper exit was not captured; see PR for that receipt caveat and Linux/macOS limits. Stacked on #204, clean merge preview against its current head; retarget #236 to main BEFORE merging #204. Ready for human review; merges when reviewed and the stack is integrated. No merge or release performed.",
